{
  "hero_headline": "AI 技术边际成本骤降与全球地缘政治经济波动并存 / AI Marginal Costs Plummet Amidst Global Geopolitical and Economic Shifts",
  "daily_overview": "今日全球资讯聚焦三大维度：技术领域，AI视频生成与自动化开发工具迭代迅速，降本增效成为主旋律，视频生成成本低至0.5元每秒，且开发效率大幅提升；财经市场方面，SAP拟裁员万人，反映软件业受AI冲击下的深度重构，同时多地能源供应与地缘冲突引发市场对能源安全的忧虑；时政层面，中东地缘紧张局势加剧，能源设施屡遭袭击，泽连斯基对美俄关系表达关切。全球经济在人工智能生产力溢出与地缘动荡的博弈中寻找平衡点。\n\nToday's global landscape is defined by three key trends: In technology, AI-driven cost reductions are sweeping through industries, with video generation costs dropping to 0.5 RMB/second and agentic development tools gaining traction. In finance, SAP's potential 10,000 job cuts signal a profound restructuring of the software sector under AI's influence, while energy security concerns mount due to regional conflicts. Politically, escalating tensions in the Middle East and Zelensky's concerns over US-Russia dynamics highlight a fragmented geopolitical order. The world is navigating a complex interplay between AI-driven productivity gains and mounting geopolitical instability.",
